&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Develop our Snowflake Intelligence AI to help empower teams to self-serve analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Remain current on technology and trends in data analytics and the sports betting &amp;amp; gaming industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
